/T (We had estimated a total weight of around 46g, but in the end, after adding the decals, we ended up with a weight of around 46.87g. The weight of the body cannot be altered, as it is not 3D-printed but milled from a block of polyurethane foam. Therefore, the weight of the car depends largely on the infill of certain components, such as the halo:)
