1231 0 obj
<<
/Title (We adjusted the design to strictly respect the virtual cargo and free volume requirements. We collaborated with Ziptec to optimize CNC tool paths. Removed un-millable vertical geometries and applied 1 mm fillets .)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1178 0 R
>>
