1236 0 obj
<<
/Title (For the front wing, it has been redesigned to be narrower, both to comply with the regulations and to suit the new bodywork dimensions, and also lower and sleeker to improve airflow both above and below it.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1181 0 R
/Next 1237 0 R
>>
endobj
1237 0 obj
<<
/Title (As for the rear wing, it has been designed with a single ring-shaped support, unlike the one used in qualifying, which greatly improves airflow. Furthermore, it has been designed asymmetrically to reduce the area of impact and improve airflow.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1181 0 R
/Prev 1236 0 R
>>
endobj
