>>
endobj
1239 0 obj
<<
/Title (Although the rear wake is wider, it features faster, less turbulent air, which compensates for the slight increase in size.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1183 0 R
>>
endobj
1240 0 obj
<<
/Title (All the other parts of the car were 3D-printed. We used a Prusa printer because it has space for several spools, which allowed us to print more quickly. We used PLA for the components and PETG for the supports.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1188 0 R
>>
